{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07602","headline":"越江秋曙 · 萧颖士","name":"越江秋曙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟东路远，晓月下江濆。\n潋灩信潮上，苍茫孤屿分。\n林声寒动叶，水气曙连云。\n暾日浪中出，榜歌天际闻。\n伯鸾常去国，安道惜离羣。\n延首剡谿近，咏言怀数君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}